            <ArticleTitle>&quot;Growing pains&quot; in childhood--a proposal for treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>402-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>&quot;Growing pains&quot; is a benign clinical entity of unknown etiology. This study examines a muscle stretching treatment based on a theory that the etiology of these pains is related to fatigue. The experimental group (18 children) showed a more rapid resolution of their symptoms over an 18 month period when compared to the control group (16 children).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
